+
+## Additive Workspace actions
+
+WorkspaceBrowser declares `sidebar.workspaces.header.action` and `sidebar.workspaces.menu.action` as root-scoped lists. Header contributions appear beside the title in the wide sidebar, outside expanded search. Menu contributions receive `{ workspaceId, onClose }` for real Workspaces and render after native Rename and Delete through the primitive Menu's children area. Contributions use normal `slots.inject` / `slots.register` lifetimes and ascending order; they disappear on contributor disposal and recover when the owner remounts. Consumers should close the native menu before opening another surface. No occupant replaces native browsing or deletion behavior.
